{"version":1,"key":"card:129","content":{"id":129,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e212fe65-0522-4c76-92ff-ccb77daadb0d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"Commander 选项分为短选项和长选项，短选项使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 开头，接"},{"type":"formatted","bold":true,"text":"单个字符"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，长选项使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"--"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 开头，后接一个或多个单词（使用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"-"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 连接）。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"d8133ed2-8489-419e-bf05-9f9827851932","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"ca18f732-d438-4479-9be0-672ed9709bdd","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const { program } = require('commander');\n\n// 短选项 -n，长选项 --name\nprogram.option('-n, --name');\nprogram.parse();\n\nconst options = program.opts();\nconsole.log(options);","collabId":"b42ce3ad-4eef-4700-b70a-6d9665fc1865","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"c4f0ddef-aa93-4294-a318-e9b91fa8e3dd","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"6b5e0f70-0a00-4cc7-8525-30a53beb179e","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"$ node demo.js -n    \n{ name: true }\n$ node demo.js --name\n{ name: true }","collabId":"fdda64ec-488f-4111-87ae-ab9f3c68efb9","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e8f8d22c-f9aa-4433-b004-b4caf1090874","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"选项后可跟参数和不跟参数，不跟参数的称为 Boolean 型选项，跟参数的称为带参数选项。对于 Boolean 型选项，如果命令行中指定了选项，那么值就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"true"},{"type":"formatted","text":"，反之就是 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"false"},{"type":"formatted","text":"。对于带参数选项，首先需要在选项后用 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"<>"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 声明，"},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"<>"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的字符随意，但是最好有意义，比如类型或者解释说明。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c242aec6-4dd6-40aa-80b4-0bf3a4a5655a","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"要获取选项值，如果声明了长选项，则可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"opts().长选项"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 获取，如果没有声明长选项，则可以通过 "},{"type":"formatted","code":true,"text":"opts().短选项"},{"type":"formatted","text":" 获取。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"32e3863e-6249-4945-b6b4-5984618792b3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果长选项是多个单词，会被转换为驼峰命名。"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"JavaScript","uuid":"9b6f2f5e-7722-4788-bb3a-7d3a0e216669","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"911d59ce-60ce-4cd9-800f-2a8fde8f6c36","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"const { program } = require('commander');\n\nprogram\n  .option('-m, --man', '是否是男性')\n  .option('-h <high>', '身高')\n  .option('-a, --age <age>')\n  .option('--first-name <name>')\n\nprogram.parse();\n\nconst options = program.opts();\nconsole.log(options);","collabId":"98561d39-574e-4fa2-96b0-f68a4d45672c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"a45d27a2-9dec-4421-b0c0-b49be6835a52","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"185c02aa-6ac4-4546-aca7-ace7afb2eb5b","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"$ node demo.js -m -h 168 --age 18 --first-name Alice\n{ man: true, h: '168', age: '18', firstName: 'Alice' }","collabId":"b2bd6a95-3368-43c6-a3f5-b643a6ffcac6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"555adcc7-8e81-4151-bea4-36cf879a35df","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"选项的传递有四种方式"}]},{"type":"code-block","language":"bash","uuid":"5ec93a66-de77-40d7-95f5-51d9413ae5c1","tauContract":"44e7818805504c164294bff3c403ed0ffed41befee37e5daeb6121e40071bbd6","collabId":"fb0ffa9b-a2db-40b6-a5cf-c7801b32d4c1","children":[{"type":"code-step","tauContract":"01b01a08366ee00321331f9860d994321d69c2da591e07b067eb5459c9edf05d","code":"-p80\n-p 80\n--port 80\n--port=80","collabId":"c24b8070-4afe-4d6d-a4d8-5145a2af6072","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["JavaScript/三方库/Commander"],"createTime":1689259039196,"updateTime":1743303640393,"linkedCards":[{"id":128,"target":{"key":"card:128","type":"card","id":128},"summary":"Commander 的下载与使用。 npm install commander 首先明白，Commander 的作用是什么，是解析命令行参数，让我们能够以易读且方便的拿到我们想要的选项和参数，而不用手动解析字符串。 举个🌰： const ...","tags":["JavaScript/三方库/Commander"]},{"id":131,"target":{"key":"card:131","type":"card","id":131},"summary":"选项后的参数可能是多个值，使用 <...> 或 [...] 的语法来表示是变长参数 program .option('--book <book>') .option('--author <author...>') .option('--pr...","tags":["JavaScript/三方库/Commander"]},{"id":130,"target":{"key":"card:130","type":"card","id":130},"summary":"Commander 对于选项参数的读取是贪婪的，如果定义了某个选项后需要跟参数，但是实际上没有给参数，那么会把后面的选项读取为参数 const { program } = require('commander'); program .opt...","tags":["JavaScript/三方库/Commander"]}]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1743303640393}}